5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited for our trip! I want to know exactly how much everything costs so there are no surprises later. Let's find a place that's super fun!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be rational. I'm tired of spending half the holiday just getting to the destination. We need to look at the travel times first.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Shunichi. We also need a clear system for the expenses so that the financial burden is distributed logically and fairly.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I just want to make sure we actually have a place to relax. I'll be looking into the room and bathroom situations.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand why some years feel too crowded and others too lonely. I'll look into how we spent our time last year.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, you're always so worried about the time! But I'll check the all-in rates and the offshore house pricing to see the total cost!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It's not worry, Rin, it's efficiency. I'll check the ferry and train times, and how we get around by train and bus.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I'll look into the separately booked rooms from last time and the all-in rates to see which is more equitable.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm checking the bathing hours and the inn mealtimes. I can't stand it when everything is too rushed or cramped.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I'll examine the time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran to find a better balance.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
