60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option A is an island, B is a hot spring town, and C is a city! I like the island's price, but the separate meals sound scary.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A is out. Two days of travel is unacceptable. Option B is fast and easy, and Option C is even more flexible.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is the most financially fair because the bill divides evenly. Option C is the least fair due to separate accommodation costs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option A's bathroom situation is a dealbreaker. Option B has great baths, but the shared room is a worry. Option C is the most comfortable.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A is too crowded, and Option C is too lonely. Option B seems to be the best compromise for keeping us together.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if Option A is the fairest for the money, maybe we can just agree on the price first? But I don't want to be cold in the bath!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, I agree. Option B gets us there quickly and keeps us as a group without the extreme isolation of the city.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, @Toshio, while B is convenient, we must consider the cost. However, A's travel time is indeed a significant drawback.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, if you think B is the best balance, I can handle the futons if it means I have a proper bath and no cold water.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, that's the spirit. Option B ensures we move as a party, avoiding the fragmentation of the city break.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm worried about the costs for Option B and C being all over the place. But I really don't want a cold shower! I'll go with B!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Option B is the only rational choice. It minimizes travel waste and maximizes our time together. I vote B.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"Since A is too far and C is too financially inconsistent, Option B is the most acceptable compromise. I vote B.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I can't do the island bathroom. Between the inn and the city, the inn feels more like a group trip. I vote B.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Option B provides the social cohesion we lacked last year without the claustrophobia of a single rented house. I vote B.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! We all agree! I'm so excited for the hot springs! I vote B!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
